3. For each number `i` in `lst2`, if `i` is even (`i%2 == 0`), increment `even` by 1. Here, `lst2` contains 2 even numbers (1, 5), so `even` is 2.
4. Since `even` (2) is greater than `odd` (1), the function returns "YES".

So, the final return value is "YES".

